## Why this license

This repository builds directly on data and model outputs that carry their
own noncommercial restrictions, verified directly from their sources:

- The CONCH slide embeddings (data/gtex.4_tissues.0.5mpp.224px.conch.h5ad)
  are archived on Zenodo (10.5281/zenodo.20709093) under CC BY-NC 4.0.
- CONCH's own license (Mahmood Lab, https://github.com/mahmoodlab/CONCH)
  extends its noncommercial restriction to "datasets created from the CONCH
  model" and "models trained on outputs from the CONCH model", which is
  exactly what the embeddings file and the classifiers trained on it in this
  repository are.

Licensing this repository under CC BY-NC 4.0 keeps every original piece here
(the site, the notebook, the analysis code) under terms no broader than what
the underlying data and model actually permit, while remaining free to use,
adapt, and redistribute for any noncommercial purpose with attribution.

GTEx's own data license (https://gtexportal.org/home/license) is more
permissive and does not itself require noncommercial use; the constraint
here comes from CONCH and the Zenodo-archived embeddings, not from GTEx.
